  "Sensei Hoshi|Now the big rule of this whole academy: take entries AT your levels, and take targets FROM your levels. Never trade in the empty middle between two lines. The middle is where beginners get chopped up.": "5d5d9d480aa31c5b.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Now the deepest wisdom: sample size . Flip a coin three times and get three heads \u2014 is the coin magic? Of course not! One green day proves NOTHING. A real strategy is judged over many, many trades \u2014 like a season, not one match.": "8c7dd555dc0b8afd.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Now the rule that matters most: a pattern only counts at a level . A hammer in the middle of nowhere is just a candle. A hammer sitting right on a floor you marked earlier? That is the market talking.": "6c47c9795fe3b6f7.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Now the secret that binds them: CONFLUENCE . One clue is a rumor. Two clues is a hint. Three clues pointing the same way is a plan! Breakout + Gap + Wall, all agreeing \u2014 that is when a strategist strikes.": "18c1664c8716683e.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Now, the special scroll of this dojo: the futures contract . It is a promise to buy or sell something at a set price on a future day.": "dbcca22bf7dac083.mp3",
