  "Sensei Hoshi|One final scroll, and it may protect you more than all the others combined. There is a demon that lives inside phones. I call it... the Hype Demon .": "1fd110173203a75d.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|One final secret map, young sage. Liquidity means how many orders are waiting to trade at each price. Some prices are quiet ponds... others are deep treasure pools full of resting orders.": "e4244edb0b5eb9b9.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|One more shape, built from three candles: the swing point . A swing high is a candle whose high is taller than the candle before AND after it. A swing low is the opposite. These are the hills and valleys we mark.": "7af7ec565850d246.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|One more thing, and it is the most important scroll of all: in this dojo we use pretend Koins . Real futures trading is very risky and only for trained adults. Master the art here first. Now \u2014 to your first quiz!": "96610223aa5e379b.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Pass the final quiz, then enter the dojo for the Boss Battle . Survive the dragon's storm and finish the day with profit \u2014 and you shall be named a Legendary Trade Master . Go forth!": "641569f18b751bad.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Pools form at the famous levels every trader watches \u2014 especially yesterday's battle marks : PDH (Previous Day High), PDL (Previous Day Low), PDO (Previous Day Open), and PDC (Previous Day Close).": "eadbd914b4b247e8.mp3",
  "Sensei Hoshi|Price moves in points . If NQ goes from 21,500 to 21,510, it moved 10 points . That is the whole trick: count the points.": "33f0a9c33afef17c.mp3",
